  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"1014\">\n<p data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"915\"><strong data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"889\">Decreased TRAIL levels</strong> may be associated with:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"1014\">\n<li data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"952\">\n<p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"952\">Cancer (due to immune evasion)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"978\">\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"978\">Autoimmune diseases</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1014\">\n<p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1014\">Chronic inflammatory conditions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1162\">\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1065\"><strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1043\">Elevated TRAIL levels</strong> may be observed in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1162\">\n<li data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1095\">\n<p data-start=\"1070\" data-end=\"1095\">Acute immune activation</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1139\">\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1139\">Response to therapy (in some cancers)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1162\">\n<p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1162\">Certain infections</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
